      "content": "CURRENT USER MESSAGE:\nWhy Cognee?\n\nPREVIOUS QUESTION:\nWhy does this project exists?\n\nPREVIOUS ANSWER:\n{\n  \"answer\": \"The Engram project exists to eliminate the continuity problem where developers lose project understanding long before they lose code, each AI session starts from zero context, AI tools have isolated context, important architectural decisions fade over time, and developers repeatedly explain the same project to different AI assistants. It provides a local-first AI memory layer that continuously understands and preserves project knowledge using Cognee and makes it instantly available to developers and AI assistants.\",\n  \"reasoning_path\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"document\",\n      \"name\": \"This chunk details the product specification for... [developers, ai, project]\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"document\",\n      \"name\": \"[FILE_MODIFIED - STRUCTURAL] Project File: PRODUCT_SPEC.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"document\",\n      \"name\": \"engram\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nSESSION CONTEXT ENTRIES SERVED TO THE PREVIOUS ANSWER (id: content):\n180e3121-2218-4329-b6b4-a24207532c55: When providing project history, include the timeline of recent events and phases.\n1fcc74e7-d3c5-4fb7-aa96-aa2cf1f6aefd: When answering about project history, include the timeline of recent events and phases.\n85512bc6-ab0f-4173-b546-a29cdc39aacc: When asked about architectural decisions, provide the most recent decisions made in the project.\nf9bbb900-5f42-40da-a426-49ae1a7c1d56: When explaining architectural decisions, include the motivation or justification for each choice.\n0c4c157a-2bb7-47c6-b9d3-e5a3577b8752: Understand recent project history and timeline.\ndf985a6f-d460-4e5b-827a-50d80e268534: User wants to know the recent project history and timeline.\n79197623-58dd-41c8-bbb1-61fce7da64a6: User wants to know the recent project history and timeline of the project.\n978be04c-09f7-464d-9630-96e8d5e50e96: User wants to know the recent architectural decisions made in the project.\na3f65122-265d-4e64-956a-9b8fe18ed1fd: User wants recent architectural decisions.\ncca4e89e-1abb-4070-aef3-74ac774fbe98: Understand the recent project history and timeline.\n5aecac0b-fb9e-43d4-80a9-003a9cba124c: Provide recent project history and timeline.\n47a02d02-413b-471b-8865-08548b39d84f: Present project history using bullet points for clarity and brevity.\nb3ed555a-c595-420f-b8a8-8728d32cacfd: Present the architectural decisions as a concise bullet\u2011point list with brief descriptions.\ne195c284-c48b-4a09-a027-945552389ab8: Structure the answer with three clearly labeled sections: Architecture Overview, Recent Decisions, and Current Focus, using bullet points for clarity.\ndabe8004-23a3-45f7-b3fe-32ef88869683: Use bullet points for clarity and brevity in presenting architectural analysis."
